cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Chatpack in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Chatpack: open-source chat infrastructure for developers"
abstract: >-
  Chatpack is an open-source TypeScript chat backend library. It provides 1:1 and
  group conversations, messages, permissions, read-state, and real-time SSE
  delivery behind a web-standard request handler, with pluggable storage
  adapters. Developers bring their own auth and frontend.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/chddaniel/chatpack"
url: "https://docs.chatpack.dev"
version: 0.11.2
date-released: "2026-08-13"
keywords:
  - chat
  - messaging
  - typescript
  - realtime
  - sse
  - backend
